                                "sense_id": "23040d0e-47d6-35c2-a3bb-3ecc5d9cacec",
                                "text": "Type D half-lines ending in words of this type are analysed by Hutcheson as ending in two completely unstressed syllables. That analysis must be descriptively correct for, say, the 10th cent.; whether it would have fitted the facts in the 8th cent. is much less clear."
